# v1.3: active path is OpenCV (vision requests appended below).
# QR blocks below are LEGACY ONLY; QR_ENABLED=false by default.
# Local UI user-authorized before gate (2026-10-18); PM API gate remains NOT_APPROVED.
# A14/B14 — local MVP API collection. No real credentials or student data.
# Run backend migrate + seed_demo first. HTTP client must keep its cookie jar.
# Before EVERY login: GET auth/me, copy csrftoken cookie to csrfToken.
# Login rotates CSRF: copy the NEW cookie value before next write.
# Change username to switch role; a login replaces the previous browser session.
# Paste UUIDs/token from responses; QR expires60s, pending verification15min.
# Do not save real passwords/tokens into this file or screenshots/evidence.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1
@username = demo_teacher_a
@password = replace-with-your-local-demo-password
@csrfToken = paste-current-csrftoken-cookie
@classId = paste-DEMO10A-class-id
@otherClassId = paste-DEMO10B-class-id
@studentId = paste-DEMOHS01-id
@secondStudentId = paste-DEMOHS02-id
@sessionId = paste-session-id
@attendanceId = paste-DEMOHS02-attendance-id-from-roster
@scanId = paste-scan-id
@qrToken = paste-fresh-token
@schoolDate = 2026-10-14
@arrivedAt = 2026-10-14T07:10:00+07:00

### Bootstrap CSRF; anonymous401 includes csrftoken; logged-in200 includes identity
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### Login teacher_a / supervisor / student_01;200 identity without password/hash
# Change username variable to demo_supervisor, demo_student_01 etc as needed.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRFToken: {{csrfToken}}

{"username":"{{username}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Teacher sees assigned classes; supervisor both; student403
GET {{baseUrl}}/classes

### Teacher sees scoped grades
GET {{baseUrl}}/grades

### Scoped student search; get UUIDs without passwords/photo paths
GET {{baseUrl}}/students?class_id={{classId}}&search=DEMOHS

### Student own minimal profile only; different student's ID404
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}

### Teacher/supervisor only; no photo seeded ->404, student403
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/photo

### Teacher own weekday rules; Mon0..Fri4, SHIRT mornings, SPORTS afternoons
GET {{baseUrl}}/classes/{{classId}}/schedule-rules

### Create dated PLANNED session201; repeat200 sameid; use weekday from seed
# schoolDate must be current local weekday for live QR demo, not weekend.
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRFToken: {{csrfToken}}

{"class_id":"{{classId}}","school_date":"{{schoolDate}}","slot":"MORNING"}

### PLANNED version0 -> OPEN version1; repeat OPEN returns200 same roster
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/open
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRFToken: {{csrfToken}}

{"expected_version":0}

### 10 snapshot roster rows, UNMARKED/NOT_APPLICABLE version0
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/roster

### Staff issues challenge201; token hash in DB, token returned only here
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/qr-challenges
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRFToken: {{csrfToken}}

{}

### Login demo_student_01 first; own today's roster sessions only
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/today-sessions

### Student sends scan201 PENDING; samekey/body retry201 sameid+timestamp
# Use fresh Idempotency-Key for a new actual action; keep this key for retry.
POST {{baseUrl}}/qr-scans
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRFToken: {{csrfToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-scan-01-replace-per-run

{"token":"{{qrToken}}"}

### PENDING scan and UNMARKED attendance; student cannot ask identity of another
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/scan-status?session_id={{sessionId}}

### Login demo_teacher_a again; queue contains snapshot identity/class/photoURL
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/qr-scans?status=PENDING

### Confirm identity at site;200 PRESENT, arrived_at=scanned_at, checked uniform
# Cutoff inclusive:7:05:00 ON_TIME;7:05:01 LATE. Live time comes from server.
POST {{baseUrl}}/qr-scans/{{scanId}}/confirm
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRFToken: {{csrfToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-confirm-01-replace-per-run

{"expected_attendance_version":0,"expected_scan_version":0,"identity_confirmed":true,"uniform":{"observed_uniform":"SHIRT","uniform_status":"COMPLIANT"}}

### Manual fallback for DEMOHS02; require aware arrivedAt same schoolDate <=now
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/attendance/{{attendanceId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRFToken: {{csrfToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-manual-02-replace-per-run

{"expected_version":0,"status":"PRESENT","arrived_at":"{{arrivedAt}}","reason":"Không có điện thoại; ghi thời gian đến đã xác minh"}

### Uniform uses current attendance version1; NON_COMPLIANT requires reason
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/attendance/{{attendanceId}}/uniform
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRFToken: {{csrfToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-uniform-02-replace-per-run

{"expected_version":1,"observed_uniform":"SPORTS","uniform_status":"NON_COMPLIANT","reason":"Buổi này yêu cầu sơ mi"}

### Check roster/queue counts before close; OPEN version1 -> CLOSED version2
# UNMARKED->ABSENT, PENDING->EXPIRED, NOT_CHECKED preserved.
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/close
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRFToken: {{csrfToken}}

{"expected_version":1}

### Snapshot detail:10items (2PRESENT,8ABSENT) for clean workflow above
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/attendance?date_from={{schoolDate}}&date_to={{schoolDate}}&class_id={{classId}}

### Expected10 present2 absent8 unmarked0 compliant1 non_compliant1 if clean demo
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/summary?date_from={{schoolDate}}&date_to={{schoolDate}}&class_id={{classId}}

### XLSX3 sheets Chi_tiet/Tong_hop/Thong_tin,5000max, timezoneVietnam
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/export?date_from={{schoolDate}}&date_to={{schoolDate}}&class_id={{classId}}&format=xlsx

### Same scoped rows, BOM UTF8/formula-safe, metadata in X-Report-* headers
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/export?date_from={{schoolDate}}&date_to={{schoolDate}}&class_id={{classId}}&format=csv

### Negative: teacher_a explicit classB filter403
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/summary?date_from={{schoolDate}}&date_to={{schoolDate}}&class_id={{otherClassId}}

### Negative: role/identity injection422; use student login for this request
POST {{baseUrl}}/qr-scans
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRFToken: {{csrfToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-invalid-identity-replace-per-run

{"token":"{{qrToken}}","student_id":"{{secondStudentId}}"}

### Logout flushes session; next protected read401
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRFToken: {{csrfToken}}

{}


### VISION v1.3: enrollment metadata, scoped staff only, no image bytes
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/face-samples

### Enrollment atomically REPLACES all samples; replace local authorized file paths.
# Never commit real face images. Exactly3-10 repeated images fields, total<=15MiB.
POST {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/face-samples
X-CSRFToken: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=VisionEnrollBoundary

--VisionEnrollBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="sample-1.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./local-private/sample-1.jpg
--VisionEnrollBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="sample-2.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./local-private/sample-2.jpg
--VisionEnrollBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="sample-3.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./local-private/sample-3.jpg
--VisionEnrollBoundary--

### Analyze one image; no student_id; PENDING must NOT write PRESENT.
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/vision-scans
X-CSRFToken: {{csrfToken}}
Idempotency-Key: vision-analysis-01-replace-per-run
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=VisionScanBoundary

--VisionScanBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="evaluation-1.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./local-private/evaluation-1.jpg
--VisionScanBoundary--

### Staff queue scoped to session; capture scan UUID/version, attendance version.
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/vision-scans

### Copy VISION scan UUID to scanId; direct staff identity check mandatory; expires120s.
POST {{baseUrl}}/vision-scans/{{scanId}}/confirm
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRFToken: {{csrfToken}}
Idempotency-Key: vision-confirm-01-replace-per-run

{"expected_scan_version":0,"expected_attendance_version":0,"identity_confirmed":true,"uniform":{"observed_uniform":"SHIRT","uniform_status":"COMPLIANT"}}

### Reject a DIFFERENT PENDING vision scan; never write PRESENT.
POST {{baseUrl}}/vision-scans/{{scanId}}/reject
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRFToken: {{csrfToken}}
Idempotency-Key: vision-reject-01-replace-per-run

{"expected_scan_version":0,"reason":"Không xác minh được người thực tế; chuyển nhập thủ công"}

### Remove private samples; invalidates pending proposals for this student.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/face-samples
X-CSRFToken: {{csrfToken}}
